# Line endings: LF everywhere, in the index and in the working tree, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# Why: with autocrlf=true, Windows checkouts got CRLF while apm deployed LF copies, so APM saw
# CRLF-only differences as "modified since deployment" and refused to update them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files are never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.epub binary
*.jar binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
